OS,         │ 443396, 37168850, 37018659,         │     │\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[0m  │ unspecified           │ overlapping colon and rectum, MSI-H,       │ 42537577                            │ 12  │\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[0m  │                       │ Lynch-type terms                           │                                     │     │\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[32;1H\u001b[0m  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────┼─────┤\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[0m  │ Optional: Appendix    │ C18.1                                      │ 443383                              │ 118 │\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[0m  └───────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┴─────┘\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[35;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[36;1H\u001b[0m  I put the transverse colon in the right colon, following the usual split at the splenic flexure. Moving it is a\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[37;1H\u001b[0m  one-line change in the script.\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[38;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[39;1H\u001b[0m  \u001b[0;1mExcluded (842 concepts):\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[40;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[41;1H\u001b[0m  - \u001b[0;1mNon-solid tumours (782):\u001b[0m every ICD-O-3 haematolymphoid code (histology 9590–9999), plus Lymphoma of colon\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[42;1H\u001b[0m    (37018876), of sigmoid colon (40486168) and of appendix (603015).\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[43;1H\u001b[0m  -\u001b[0m\u001b[K\u001b[44;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[K"]
